<title>USA: Eastern Co sees improved Q1 results.</title>
<headline>Eastern Co sees improved Q1 results.</headline>
<dateline>NAUGATUCK, Conn. 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Eastern Co said on Wednesday that it expects a much improved first quarter since its results for the first two months of the year are ahead of its targets.</p>
<p>In last year's first quarter, the company reported sales of $14.5 million and net income of $202,000, or $0.07 a share.</p>
